# The translation singleton, as its own module directory.
#
# ⚠ NOT BESIDE syn-edit.qml. A qmldir makes its directory an explicit QML
# module, and syn-edit.qml is the file quickshell is pointed AT — putting one
# next to it changes how that file itself is resolved. A subdirectory has no
# such effect, and it keeps the generated catalogs (qml/i18n/*.json) beside the
# singleton that looks for them, which is how I18n.qml finds them at all.
singleton I18n 1.0 I18n.qml
